  "title": "Light Indulgent Peruvian Beef Lomo Saltado",
  "description": "A peppery and light Peruvian dish featuring chopped parsley and kombu cold extract, made keto friendly, in the form of lomo saltado. This recipe is a unique twist on the classic dish.",
