  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the beef strips and cook until browned, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped parsley and kombu cold extract, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the parsley is wilted.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot over cauliflower rice or zucchini noodles.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
